            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Torrid 0.1.3</h2>
<p>Wording cleanup.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Settings: the video tools are now listed by name (yt-dlp, script runtime, FFmpeg), and three explanatory sentences were removed from the Video, BitTorrent and Speed Limits pages.</li>
  <li>About window: shorter tagline.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Torrid 0.1.3（简体中文）</h2>
<p>文案整理。</p>
<ul>
  <li>设置：视频工具按名字列出（yt-dlp、JavaScript 运行环境、FFmpeg）；视频、BT、限速三页各去掉一句说明。</li>
  <li>关于窗口：一句话简介更短了。</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
