        <item>
            <title>0.1.2</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 21:39:27 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/cobaltdisco/torrid-releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Torrid 0.1.2</h2>
<p>A small follow-up to 0.1.1.</p>
<ul>
  <li>BitTorrent: Torrid now identifies itself to peers and trackers as Torrid (client code “TO”) instead of borrowing another client’s code. Private trackers that check the client identity will see a consistent peer ID and user agent.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Torrid 0.1.2（简体中文）</h2>
<p>0.1.1 的一个小补丁。</p>
<ul>
  <li>BT：Torrid 现在以自己的身份（客户端代号「TO」）向其他节点和 tracker 报到，不再借用别家客户端的代号。会核对客户端身份的私有站看到的 peer ID 与 User-Agent 从此一致。</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
